# Mode$ AttackerBlockedOnce (PhaseHandler.java:816-820): Hezrou's "whenever
# one or more creatures you control become blocked, each blocking creature
# gets -1/-1" fires once for the whole declaration, not once per blocked
# attacker. Hezrou (6/6) and Grizzly Bears (2/2) attack; Hill Giant (3/3)
# blocks Hezrou and Silvercoat Lion (2/2) blocks the Bears. One trigger makes
# them 2/2 and 1/1: the Giant deals Hezrou 2, the Lion deals the Bears 1, and
# both blockers die. Fired twice, the Lion would die before damage and the
# Bears would take none.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1,2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 3=1,4=2
declareblockers
resolvestack
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance
